1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:19,320
Which legal articles in the reading state children's rights?

2
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:31,750
Answer: Articles 15, 16, 17 state children's rights.

3
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:39,670
What rights do those legal articles say children have?

4
00:00:40,750 --> 00:01:00,620
You read the names of rights stated in Articles 15, 16, 17 on screen.

5
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:08,920
Article 15. Right to care and nurturing.

6
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:20,620
Article 16. Right to education, learning and talent development.

7
00:01:20,620 --> 00:01:31,970
Article 17. Right to play and recreation.

8
00:01:32,950 --> 00:01:40,850
Which legal articles in the reading talk about children's rights?

9
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:45,100
You observe the answer.

10
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:51,420
Article 15. Right to care and nurturing:

11
00:01:51,420 --> 00:02:00,750
Children have the right to be cared for and nurtured to develop comprehensively.

12
00:02:00,750 --> 00:02:14,420
Article 16. Right to education, learning and talent development.

13
00:02:14,420 --> 00:02:28,220
1. Children have the right to education, learning to develop comprehensively and best promote their own potential.

14
00:02:28,220 --> 00:02:44,620
2. Children are equal in learning and education opportunities; talents, aptitudes, creativity, inventions are developed.

15
00:02:45,370 --> 00:02:53,800
Article 17. Right to play and recreation.

16
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:58,950
Children have the right to play and recreation;

17
00:02:58,950 --> 00:03:14,670
equal opportunities to participate in cultural, arts, physical education, sports, tourism activities suitable for their age.

